  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "もたせた　ポケモンの\nのうりょくが　さがると\nてもちと　いれかわる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "지니게 한 포켓몬의\n능력이 떨어지면\n지닌 포켓몬과 교체한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當攜帶它的寶可夢能力降低時，\n將自動和同行寶可夢進行替換。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Si le porteur subit une baisse de stats,\nil revient vers son Dresseur et change de place\navec un coéquipier.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Erleidet der Träger eine Senkung seiner Statuswerte,\nwird er mit einem Team-Mitglied ausgewechselt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si el portador ve reducidas sus características, será\nsustituido por otro Pokémon del equipo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon. Se le sue statistiche\ndiminuiscono, viene sostituito da un altro Pokémon\ndella squadra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. When the holder’s\nstats are lowered, it will be switched out of battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせた　ポケモンの\n能力が　下がると\n手持ちと　入れ替わる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "当携带它的宝可梦能力下降时，\n同行宝可梦就会自动替换上场。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si el portador ve reducidas sus características, será\nsustituido por otro Pokémon del equipo.",
